# schemas/contract-schemas.sha256 — contract-schema pin (issue #98, REQ-D98).
#
# Five of the six files are vendored byte-exact from upstream OpenRig:
# `bundle-behaviour`, `bundle-common`, `bundle-configurations`,
# `bundle-status` and `registry-entry` `.v1.schema.json` come from
# `package/daemon/docs/reference/schemas/` in the `npm pack @openrig/cli@0.7.2`
# tarball (sha256 42b4d4980c062f49f99db7e843a2ba96c0066a420cbaace381f435e22699d4c5,
# the digest in schemas/rigspec-keys.pinned.json); 0.6.13 ships the same
# bytes. When `rig` is on PATH, verify-rigs V18 `cmp`s them against the
# installed package's copies. Do not edit them; refresh them only from a
# newer pinned tarball, together with this pin.
#
# `agent-manifest.v1.schema.json` stays heretek-local: upstream ships no
# agent-manifest schema.
#
# Format is `sha256sum` output (re-verify with
# `sha256sum -c schemas/contract-schemas.sha256`).
05f83aeff3d548b26165ba458c2ff21dd64798ea01990b67b86b40b2988c56bd  agent-manifest.v1.schema.json
